{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And you shall blow the trumpets.</b> So that Israel hear and know that the offerings are being brought and direct their hearts toward heaven." "<b>And over the sacrifices of your peace-offerings.</b> The lambs of Atzeret — for they would blow the trumpets only for a communal offering and an obligation." "<b>And it shall be a remembrance for you.</b> For on the day of your rejoicing, that is, on your appointed seasons, you blow over your burnt offerings, and when you blow and sound the alarm for war, He will remember for you the merit of the offerings and you will be saved."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:13.543473322Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}